    "preamble": "Betwee N vs ) on 19 July, 2023 \\_ -` -I In The High Court Of Andhra Pradesh At AIVIARAVATll\\`' Wednesday, The Nineteenth Day Of July Two Thousand And Twenty Three :Present: The Honourable Sri Justice K Suresh Reedy Criminal Petition No: 4783 Of 2023 Betwee n : Kurmala Balasankar Gupta @ sankar, s/o. venkata satyanarayana, aged 45 years, R/o. Padmanabhunipeta, Epurupalem, chirala Mandal, Prakasam District. ..Petitioner/Accused-21 And The State ofAndhra Pradesh, Rep'. by I'tS Public ProsecutorI Hl'gh Court Buildings, Amaravathi. ) ...Respondentlcomplainant petition under sectl'on 4.38 of Cr.P.C, is filed praying that in the circumstances stated in the Memorandum of grounds filed in support of the criminal peltion, the High Court may be pleased to enlarge the petitioner/Accused-21 on ba\" in the event of his arrest in Fir No,4 of 2020, dated 05-01-2020 on the file of Krishnapatnam port police station, sri potti sri Ramulu Nellore DistrI'Ct, Pending Investigation in the interest of JustiJce. The Petition coming on for hearing, upon perusing the petl'tion and the Memorandum of grounds filed in support thereof and made herein and upon hearing the arguments of Sri Raja Reddy Koneti Advocate for the petitioner, Public Prosecutor, for the Respondent, The Court made the followl'ng The Hon'Ble Sri JrUSTICE K. Suresh Reddy 'Criminal Petition No. 4783 Of 2O23 Order:",
